  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Four electrical equipotentials are shown in the diagram. The values shown are in V. An electron is placed at point P and released. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is correct about the acceleration and the direction of motion of the electron?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Acceleration</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Direction of motion</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Unchanged</td>\n<td>To the right</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Unchanged</td>\n<td>To the left</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Increasing</td>\n<td>To the right</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Increasing</td>\n<td>To the left</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
